# Incremental-build state. tsconfig.base.json sets "incremental": true, so each package writes a
# tsconfig.tsbuildinfo recording what it already emitted. Copying that into an image while **/dist
# is excluded tells tsc everything is up to date when no output exists at all — it emits nothing,
# dist is never created, and every package importing it fails to resolve. That is what broke the
# image build for @velchat/crypto and @velchat/feature-contracts.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
